  message: "Re-confirmed + node-side quantified on fresh substrate (dogfood_tranche_07 F140.A2): metrics.languages.<lang>.nodes over-counts python +248 (metrics 33846 vs actual 33598), javascript +11 (13 vs 2), typescript +3 (67 vs 64) = exactly 262 = the count of language=None synthetic-linker nodes, folded into specific language buckets by id-prefix; metrics.languages.unknown.nodes=0 (no None/unknown bucket). All other languages match exactly; Sigma metrics.nodes=34396=total. This is the node-side quantification this row's symptom names but never measured (the prior facet measured only the 120-edge side)."  # abb9
